On behalf of the United States of America, I extend my best wishes to the people of Nauru as you celebrate 58 years of independence.

This day is an important commemoration of Nauru’s vibrant history and heritage. The United States is committed to strengthening our relationship with Nauru as we work together toward our shared goal of building a peaceful and prosperous Pacific.

I wish all Nauruans a joyful celebration of your national day.